# Diagnostics of a network TC32 (board type ETH_TC32): the cold-junction temperature of each thermocouple
# channel and, for the base bank, the mains rejection frequency, the calibration table and the factory and
# field calibration dates. Load this file only for a network TC32, after TC32.substitutions, with the
# macros P and PORT. TC32.substitutions also serves the USB TC-32, whose driver rejects these settings, so
# it does not contain these records.

file "$(MEASCOMP)/db/measCompTemperatureCJC.template"
{
pattern
{    R, ADDR, PREC}
{ Ti0,    0,    2}
{ Ti1,    1,    2}
{ Ti2,    2,    2}
{ Ti3,    3,    2}
{ Ti4,    4,    2}
{ Ti5,    5,    2}
